{
  "declaredLength": 8480,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10010000201000000002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tú eres <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella rival del gran Gauri?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400FA0020006500720065007300200010000201000000002C002000100003110000FF02020065006C006C006100200072006900760061006C002000640065006C0020006700720061006E002000470061007500720069003F00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos han contado miles de historias acerca de ti.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0073002000680061006E00200063006F006E007400610064006F0020006D0069006C0065007300200064006500200068006900730074006F00720069006100730020006100630065007200630061002000640065002000740069002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me llamo Palmira y me encanta\nel Pokémon Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650020006C006C0061006D006F002000500061006C006D006900720061002000790020006D006500200065006E00630061006E00740061000A0065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020005400680072006F0068002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¡te me adelantaste! ¡Qué malos\nmodales tienen los fans de los Throh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo soy Cosco, un gran admirador del Pokémon\nSawk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00200073006F007900200043006F00730063006F002C00200075006E0020006700720061006E002000610064006D0069007200610064006F0072002000640065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A005300610077006B002E00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Permíteme que te explique qué sucede aquí,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006D00ED00740065006D006500200071007500650020007400650020006500780070006C006900710075006500200071007500E90020007300750063006500640065002000610071007500ED002C000A0010000201000000002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como habrás podido comprobar, ambos adoran\na sus Pokémon, una a Throh y el otro a Sawk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y decidieron tener un combate por equipos de\ncinco para decidir cuál de los dos es más fuerte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estaba buscando a un quinto integrante para mi\nequipo. ¡Qué bueno que apareciste!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Otra vez! De veras que no puede uno descuidarse\ncon estos amantes de los Throh, ¡qué descaro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te informo que yo también estoy buscando\na un quinto miembro para mi equipo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, cálmense los dos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007600650072002C0020006300E1006C006D0065006E007300650020006C006F007300200064006F0073002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, ¿a quién quieres brindarle\ntu ayuda?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000010000201000000002C002000BF0061002000710075006900E9006E002000710075006900650072006500730020006200720069006E006400610072006C0065000A00740075002000610079007500640061003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, dale una mano a mi equipo de Sawk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C002000640061006C006500200075006E00610020006D0061006E006F002000610020006D0069002000650071007500690070006F0020006400650020005300610077006B002E00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, ayuda a mi equipo de Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C002000610079007500640061002000610020006D0069002000650071007500690070006F0020006400650020005400680072006F0068002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Habla conmigo cuando tu equipo esté formado\ntan solo por un Sawk o un Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, así que elegiste a Sawk.\n¿Quieres unirte a su equipo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C00200061007300ED002000710075006500200065006C006500670069007300740065002000610020005300610077006B002E000A00BF005100750069006500720065007300200075006E006900720074006500200061002000730075002000650071007500690070006F003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, así que elegiste a Throh.\n¿Quieres unirte a su equipo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C00200061007300ED002000710075006500200065006C006500670069007300740065002000610020005400680072006F0068002E000A00BF005100750069006500720065007300200075006E006900720074006500200061002000730075002000650071007500690070006F003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No hay problema. Piensa bien a qué equipo\nte quieres unir y avísame.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006800610079002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0061002E0020005000690065006E007300610020006200690065006E0020006100200071007500E9002000650071007500690070006F000A007400650020007100750069006500720065007300200075006E006900720020007900200061007600ED00730061006D0065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cosco, tu equipo de Sawk ya tiene a su quint<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\nintegrante.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F00730063006F002C002000740075002000650071007500690070006F0020006400650020005300610077006B0020007900610020007400690065006E0065002000610020007300750020007100750069006E007400100003110000FF0101006F0061000A0069006E00740065006700720061006E00740065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Con <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂélella, seguro que ganamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E002000100003110000FF040200E9006C0065006C006C0061002C002000730065006700750072006F0020007100750065002000670061006E0061006D006F0073002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Palmira, tu equipo de Throh ya está completo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061006C006D006900720061002C002000740075002000650071007500690070006F0020006400650020005400680072006F0068002000790061002000650073007400E100200063006F006D0070006C00650074006F002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué honor que hayas elegido ayudarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E900200068006F006E006F0072002000710075006500200068006100790061007300200065006C0065006700690064006F0020006100790075006400610072006D0065002100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tomada ya la decisión, que empiece el combate\nentre los equipos de Sawk y Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si no les parece mal, seré yo quien arbitre\nel combate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006E006F0020006C0065007300200070006100720065006300650020006D0061006C002C002000730065007200E900200079006F00200071007500690065006E00200061007200620069007400720065000A0065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voy a explicarles las reglas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEl orden de combates es el siguiente: avanzada,\nsubalterno, defensor, general y capitán.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuien más combates gane será el vencedor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Todo listo? ¡A combatir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006F0064006F0020006C006900730074006F003F002000A1004100200063006F006D00620061007400690072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Combate de avanzada:\n¡Sawk el Ventarrón contra Throh el Raudo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00620061007400650020006400650020006100760061006E007A006100640061003A000A00A1005300610077006B00200065006C002000560065006E007400610072007200F3006E00200063006F006E0074007200610020005400680072006F006800200065006C00200052006100750064006F002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006900630074006F007200690061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ganó Sawk el Ventarrón!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470061006E00F30020005300610077006B00200065006C002000560065006E007400610072007200F3006E002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A continuación, combate entre subalternos:\n¡Sawk el Feroz contra Throh el Entusiasta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006900630074006F007200690061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ganó Throh el Entusiasta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470061006E00F30020005400680072006F006800200065006C00200045006E00740075007300690061007300740061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seguimos con el combate entre defensores:\n¡Sawk el Inquebrantable contra Throh el Veloz!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006900630074006F007200690061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ganó Throh el Veloz! El equipo de los Throh\nlleva la delantera, dos victorias a una.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les llegó el turno a los generales:\n¡Sawk el Letal contra Throh el Experto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006900630074006F007200690061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sawk el Letal obtuvo la victoria! Hizo\nempatar a su equipo: dos victorias cada uno.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El desenlace final recae en los capitanes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200064006500730065006E006C006100630065002000660069006E0061006C00200072006500630061006500200065006E0020006C006F00730020006300610070006900740061006E00650073002E002E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que salgan los capitanes: ¡Sawk la Revelación\ncontra Throh el Demonio Rojo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que salgan los capitanes: ¡Sawk el Demonio Azul\ncontra Throh la Revelación!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Todo listo? ¡A combatir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006F0064006F0020006C006900730074006F003F002000A1004100200063006F006D00620061007400690072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10056006900630074006F007200690061002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La victoria es para <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella Capit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂ánana del Equipo Sawk:\n¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200076006900630074006F00720069006100200065007300200070006100720061002000100003110000FF02020065006C006C006100200043006100700069007400100003110000FF030200E1006E0061006E0061002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020005300610077006B003A000A00A10010000201000000002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por fin! Demostramos lo impresionantes\nque son los Sawk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000660069006E0021002000440065006D006F0073007400720061006D006F00730020006C006F00200069006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E007400650073000A00710075006500200073006F006E0020006C006F00730020005300610077006B002E00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Debo reconocer que fue un combate épico.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650062006F0020007200650063006F006E006F0063006500720020007100750065002000660075006500200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002000E9007000690063006F002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias! Pero buena parte del mérito\nes de <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEspero que a la próxima puedas demostrarme\ntú lo fuertes que son los Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La victoria es para <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella Capit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂ánana del Equipo Throh:\n¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué alegría! Demostramos lo maravillosos\nque son mis queridos Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E900200061006C00650067007200ED00610021002000440065006D006F0073007400720061006D006F00730020006C006F0020006D00610072006100760069006C006C006F0073006F0073000A00710075006500200073006F006E0020006D006900730020007100750065007200690064006F00730020005400680072006F0068002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está claro que no tenía oportunidad alguna\ncontra los agarres de tus Throh.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te lo agradezco! Pero esta victoria no habría sido\nposible sin <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEspero que la próxima vez seas tú quien\ndemuestre lo grandiosos que son los Sawk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me alegra ver cómo elogian al otro sin tener\nen cuenta el resultado del combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡A eso le llamo yo espíritu deportivo! Es lo\nque caracteriza a las artes marciales.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, gracias a ti también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 203
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No te interesaría formar parte de mi equipo\nde forma permanente?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004E006F00200074006500200069006E007400650072006500730061007200ED006100200066006F0072006D006100720020007000610072007400650020006400650020006D0069002000650071007500690070006F000A0064006500200066006F0072006D00610020007000650072006D0061006E0065006E00740065003F00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tienes las puertas abiertas para unirte a mi\nequipo de Throh cuando quieras.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 8000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
